cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Synesis: A DSL compiler for knowledge engineering"
abstract: >
  synesis-coder is the LLM-assisted annotation component of the Synesis ecosystem.
  It provides CLI modes for item extraction, document processing, abstract batch
  annotation, ontology generation, and ACT pipeline phases (critique, normalize,
  incorporate, finetune). Supports Anthropic and OpenAI-compatible backends with
  deterministic JSON assembly and free-text fallback paths.
authors:
